# EmDash basics

- CMS content pages are server-rendered; do not use `getStaticPaths()` for CMS routes.
- Image fields are objects `{ src, alt }`; use `<Image image={...} />` from `emdash/ui`.
- `entry.id` is the slug; `entry.data.id` is the database ULID.
- Taxonomy query names must match seed `"name"` exactly (e.g. `category`).
- Prefer `emdash-docs` MCP / Context7 before changing schema, hooks, or Portable Text blocks.
- Seed file: `seed/seed.json`.
